  "body": "The Business Analyst role aligns with my experience in analyzing datasets, engineering data-driven systems, and generating KPI-driven insights to evaluate growth patterns. My MSc in Data Science from Coimbatore Institute of Technology provides a solid foundation for conducting structured quantitative analysis and evaluating payment and transaction trends.\n\nMy practical experience includes leveraging SQL, DAX, Power BI, Power Query, and Excel to analyze RBI UPI transaction datasets totaling over 15 lakh crore rupees, evaluating payment trends and state-wise growth patterns to deliver insights into transaction velocity. In another project, NETRATAX, I used SQL, Python, PostgreSQL, and Neo4j to analyze over 500,000 GST transaction records across states to identify shell entities and circular trading patterns. Additionally, during my work at Unirols Airtex, I used React and Flask to structure product data for improved navigation and integrated an AI chatbot to automate product inquiries.\n\nI look forward to discussing how my background in SQL, data modeling, Power BI, and quantitative analysis fits this role.",
